{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# GGYGO 模块依赖\n\n箭头方向 = 依赖方向（A → B 表示 A 依赖 B）。\n\n**判断一个模块能否独立理解**：看它出边的数量。\n`System/` 零出边，可以先看；`GameModes/` 指向多数模块，最后看。\n\n速查：[[模块参考]]　计划入口：[[计划蓝图]]　Boss：[[计划_BOSSAI]]","x":-1460,"y":-700,"width":460,"height":260,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"character","type":"text","text":"## Character/\n\n角色本体 + 四个组件：\nPawnExtension（协调）\nHealth（生命韧性）\nCMC（移动）\nHero（输入）\n\n角色基类当前不持有 ASC；PawnExtension 消费外部注入，\n但不依赖宿主必须是 CharacterSlot。\n玩家来自 Slot，计划 Boss 来自 BossState；简单怪物可自持。\n\n子图：[[GGYGO_模块_角色与组件.canvas]]","x":-320,"y":200,"width":400,"height":340,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"system","type":"text","text":"## System/\n\n`GGYGOGameplayTags`\n`UGGYGOAssetManager`\n`UGGYGOGameData`\n\n**零依赖**，被所有模块引用。\nTag 是跨模块通信的公共词汇表。","x":-280,"y":-910,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"input","type":"text","text":"## Input/\n\n`UGGYGOInputConfig`\n`UGGYGOInputComponent`\n\n只依赖 System 的 Tag。\n按键与能力各自只认 Tag，\n两边可独立替换。","x":-760,"y":-900,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"gas","type":"text","text":"## AbilitySystem/\n\n**中枢**。ASC、能力基类、属性集、\n组仲裁、伤害结算、Cue、Montage 任务。\n\n状态变更的唯一入口 ——\n除移动输入外，任何改变角色状态的\n行为都经 `TryActivateAbility`\n或 `ApplyGameplayEffect`。\n\n子图：[[GGYGO_模块_AbilitySystem.canvas]]","x":-320,"y":-300,"width":400,"height":300,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"teams","type":"text","text":"## Teams/ · Player/\n\n`AGGYGOCharacterSlot` ← 玩家 ASC 与属性集的宿主\n`UGGYGOSquadComponent`\n`UGGYGOSquadPresets`（编队存档）\n`AGGYGOPlayerState` / `AGGYGOPlayerController`\n\n队伍挂 PlayerState；预设（落盘）→ 名单（一局）→ 位置。\n计划中 CharacterSlot 继承最小 `CombatantState`，\n但玩家 Owner、Mixed 复制与编队语义仍只留在 Slot。\n\n子图：[[GGYGO_模块_队伍与装配.canvas]]","x":-1920,"y":50,"width":340,"height":430,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"rule","type":"text","text":"## 层间铁律\n\n1. 上层只产出请求，不直接改状态\n2. 状态变更的唯一入口是 GAS\n3. 表现层只读\n4. 移动层是唯一例外，权威是 CMC\n5. 不存在第二个帧调度器 ——\n   CMC 自己 Tick、AnimInstance 自己 Update、\n   GAS 自己驱动","x":170,"y":-1240,"width":400,"height":280,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"physics","type":"text","text":"## Physics/\n\n`UGGYGOPhysicalMaterialWithTags`\n\n零依赖。让「打到什么东西上」\n变成可查询的 Tag。","x":370,"y":-750,"width":300,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"gamemodes","type":"text","text":"## GameModes/\n\n`UGGYGOExperienceDefinition`\n`AGGYGOGameMode`\n\n**依赖所有人**。读 Experience，\n生成队伍、注入 PawnData、\n激活 GameFeature。\n\n换玩法模式 = 换一个资产引用。","x":-320,"y":1040,"width":400,"height":260,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"combat","type":"text","text":"## Combat/\n\n`UGGYGOMeleeTraceComponent`\n\n依赖 Character（取骨骼位置）。\n命中结果交给 GAS 应用伤害 GE。","x":765,"y":990,"width":320,"height":180,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"camera","type":"text","text":"## Camera/\n\n相机模式栈。\n\n依赖 Character 取跟随目标；\n被 GAS 依赖（能力可推入模式）。\n\n子图：[[GGYGO_模块_表现层.canvas]]","x":1160,"y":540,"width":320,"height":220,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"anim","type":"text","text":"## Animation/zzzAnim/\n\n快照 → 过渡判定 → 表现记忆。\n\n**只读**依赖 Character（读 CMC）。\n唯一反向通道是 AnimNotify，\n只发事件不写状态。\n\n子图：[[GGYGO_模块_移动与位移.canvas]]","x":1300,"y":910,"width":340,"height":260,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"ai","type":"text","text":"## AI/ · Boss/（阶段 A–C 已实现）\n\n`BossState`：跨 Pawn 的 ASC / 属性 / Phase / Form\n`BossAIController`：Brain、确定性随机流、动作权重\n`BossActionSet`：语义动作候选\nBT Task：过滤、选择并请求 GAS 激活\n\n不依赖 Teams 业务；依赖 Character 的 Avatar 契约、AbilitySystem 执行链与 System Tag。Perception / Threat / CombatTarget 属于阶段 D。\n\n子图：[[GGYGO_BOSSAI架构.canvas]]","x":945,"y":-390,"width":430,"height":390,"color":"2"}
	],
	"edges":[
